<title>POLAND: Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two stocks fell, one rose and four were flat in 5.9-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Friday. The remaining eight stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 1.6 percent to 155.5 zlotys in a 27.6-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
